## 3. Permissions

Subject to the conditions of this license, Licensor grants the following worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free permissions. Each permission applies only for the purpose it states.

### 3.1 Personal noncommercial use

An individual may use, copy, and modify the Software for Personal Noncommercial Use.

### 3.2 Exempt Institutions

An Exempt Institution may use, copy, and modify the Software for its Own Ordinary Operations.

### 3.3 Service providers acting for an exempt user

A contractor, service provider, or volunteer may install, configure, operate, maintain, and modify the Software on behalf of an Exempt Institution, or of an individual who qualifies under Section 3.1. It may do so only for that institution's Own Ordinary Operations or that individual's Personal Noncommercial Use.

The provider may charge for its own labour and services. The provider may not:

1. use an installation for its own operations, or for anyone other than the Exempt Institution or individual that installation serves;
2. charge a fee for the Software itself, or resell it; or
3. run the Software on infrastructure the provider controls as a hosting offering to more than one customer.

A provider may operate separate installations for several Exempt Institutions or individuals only if each installation is dedicated to one of them and runs on infrastructure that the institution or individual controls or has contracted for in its own name.

### 3.4 Evaluation

Any individual or organization may inspect, build, install in a non-production environment, test, and modify the Software to:

1. evaluate its security;
2. evaluate whether to obtain or use it, including under a commercial license; or
3. prepare a contribution offered to Licensor.

This includes individuals, freelancers, businesses, Government Bodies, and auditors acting for any of them. This permission does not cover production use, meaning use of the Software to carry out an organization's actual work. It also does not cover client work, resale, or a hosted service.

### 3.5 No activation

This license does not require activation, usage reporting, or usage metering.

