Charging for installation, support, or other services under Section 3.3 is not a sale of the Software under item 4.

Each recipient receives permissions directly from Licensor under this license. A recipient's permissions depend on that recipient's own situation under Section 3. Redistribution does not give a recipient more permissions than it qualifies for, and must not give it fewer.

